<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-6711] DataRegionMetrics#totalAllocatedPages is not valid after node restart</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6711</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently, data region metric tracks total allocated pages by a callback on page allocation. However, when a node with enabled persistence is started, some of the pages are already allocated, which leads to an incorrect metric value.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
